            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EStay at a 3* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWith less dinners included\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFor more (or fewer) days\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022#tailor-your-sights-d5c6\u0022\u003EInclude different excursions\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBring a specialist lecturer\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInclude all entrance fees \u0026amp; gratuities\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. Tailor make this tour exclusively for your group to suit your members\u2019 budget or preferences. You could:"
        },
